WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:10.264
Tuesday, September 29, 2026. The East Room of the White House.

2
00:00:11.151 --> 00:00:14.564
President Trump hosts a lunch about one subject:

3
00:00:14.564 --> 00:00:16.144
Super Intelligence.

4
00:00:16.964 --> 00:00:23.784
Around the table sit the leaders of America's biggest SI companies. Rivals, side by side.

5
00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.764
By the end of the day, three things had happened.

6
00:00:27.764 --> 00:00:35.464
One. Six leading companies signed a voluntary safety pledge: the White House Accord on Super Intelligence.

7
00:00:35.684 --> 00:00:45.624
Two. The President signed an order. Federal agencies now say Super Intelligence, or SI, where they used to say artificial intelligence.

8
00:00:45.844 --> 00:00:53.544
Three. A new website went live, America.gov, where you can ask the government questions in plain language.

9
00:00:53.977 --> 00:01:00.104
One lunch. Three announcements. And a big question: what comes next?
